# Estrategia actual: variables de entorno + plugins (withLocalProperties + withAndroidReleaseSigning).
# En cada prebuild se puede regenerar android/local.properties con:
#   ANDROID_HOME, ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PATH, ANDROID_KEYSTORE_ALIAS,
#   ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD, ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD
#
# Si prefieres editar a mano android/local.properties (sin subir a git si contiene secretos),
# añade las mismas claves MYAPP_UPLOAD_* que escribe el plugin:
#
# sdk.dir=C:/Users/TU/AppData/Local/Android/Sdk
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_STORE_FILE=C:/ruta/a/release.keystore
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_KEY_ALIAS=tu_alias
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_STORE_PASSWORD=***
# MYAPP_UPLOAD_KEY_PASSWORD=***
